  "question": {
    "text": "Let the tangents <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></math> are drawn to <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math> from any point <math><mi>P</mi></math> on the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The angle subtended by the chord of contact <math><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> at the vertex of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is"
  },
